From: Rezoss <rezoss79@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Allow suggested replies on upgraded devices

HoneyBoard restricts its modern suggested-replies capability to devices
launched on API 35 or newer. Allow the capability on upgraded devices while
leaving the account, work-profile, user preference, and policy checks intact.

---
 smali/Y8/a.smali | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali/Y8/a.smali b/smali/Y8/a.smali
--- a/smali/Y8/a.smali
+++ b/smali/Y8/a.smali
@@ -1770,4 +1770,6 @@
     :goto_1e
+    const/4 v1, 0x1
+
     sput-boolean v1, LY8/a;->K:Z
 
     invoke-static {}, LY8/a;->e()LYa/b;
-- 
2.51.0
